    "body_content": "<h2>Welcome to Unit 1</h2><p>In this lesson we practise the verb <strong>to be</strong> in short, everyday sentences.</p><ul><li>I <em>am</em> a student.</li><li>You <em>are</em> my friend.</li><li>She <em>is</em> at home.</li></ul><p>Keep sentences short and listen for the sound of <code>am / is / are</code> as you read.</p>"
